<p>This document is the specification of a vocabulary and provides a shared conceptual framework for certain concepts.</p>
<p>On 04/10/2018, this document was published as a Standard by the OSLO Data Standards working group, ratified by the steering body Flemish Information and ICT Policy on 03/07/2018. 
This standard has the status of 'voluntarily applicable'.</p>

